<title>INDIA: INDIAN ANNUALISED INTEREST RATE ON FORWARD DOLLARS.</title>
<headline>INDIAN ANNUALISED INTEREST RATE ON FORWARD DOLLARS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  2.55 %			C/S =  2.55 %</p>
<p>	   O/N =  2.55 %			O/N =  2.55 %</p>
<p>	   T/N =  2.55 %			T/N =  2.55 %</p>
<p>		 Aug 14, 1997			 Aug  13, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  3.06 %     1 month forward =  3.06 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  3.41 %     2 month forward =  3.40 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.75 %     3 month forward =  3.85 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  4.17 %     4 month forward =  4.17 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  4.49 %     5 month forward =  4.42 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  4.59 %     6 month forward =  4.53 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
